    "detailed_description": "The capital of his native Yuldigard Alzia is torn apart by a civil war, in order to avoid death, the prince has to flee the city, pretending to be a wanderer.  He has to find refuge in the provincial town of Torchbergen, but this visit is destined to drag on for a long time ...<br />\r\nThe game is visual novell-detective thriller<br />\r\nIn the game you will find:<br />\r\nExciting plot and dialogs<br />\r\nSometimes simple and sometimes not very puzzles<br />\r\nSeveral endings<br />\r\nThe consequences of each choice<br />\r\nCarefully created characters both externally and internally<br />\r\nPoint-and-click elements of gameplay<br />\r\nBeautiful soundtrack by Xanarini",
